  <text id="a11y-title-1" x="160" y="360" width="410" height="23" font="body" size="18" color="bg-main"><strong>Estados perceptibles</strong></text>
  <text id="a11y-body-1" x="160" y="392" width="410" height="28" font="caption" size="13" color="#526274">Color, iconos y etiquetas textuales comunican asistencia, actividades y decisiones.</text>
  <shape id="a11y-card-2" type="rect" x="664" y="340" width="536" height="105" corner-radius="17" fill="surface-silver" shadow="true"/>
  <icon id="a11y-icon-2" name="hand" x="692" y="369" width="32" height="32" color="bg-main"/>
  <text id="a11y-title-2" x="744" y="360" width="410" height="23" font="body" size="18" color="bg-main"><strong>Interacción visible</strong></text>
  <text id="a11y-body-2" x="744" y="392" width="410" height="28" font="caption" size="13" color="#526274">Tarjetas y botones con padding, feedback de presión y acciones explícitas.</text>
  <shape id="a11y-card-3" type="rect" x="80" y="475" width="536" height="105" corner-radius="17" fill="surface-silver" shadow="true"/>
  <icon id="a11y-icon-3" name="route" x="108" y="504" width="32" height="32" color="bg-main"/>
  <text id="a11y-title-3" x="160" y="495" width="410" height="23" font="body" size="18" color="bg-main"><strong>Navegación coherente</strong></text>
  <text id="a11y-body-3" x="160" y="527" width="410" height="28" font="caption" size="13" color="#526274">Pestañas persistentes, volver visible y cambio de identidad en una única ruta.</text>
  <shape id="a11y-card-4" type="rect" x="664" y="475" width="536" height="105" corner-radius="17" fill="#FFF6D7" shadow="true"/>
  <icon id="a11y-icon-4" name="clipboard-check" x="692" y="504" width="32" height="32" color="bg-main"/>
  <text id="a11y-title-4" x="744" y="495" width="410" height="23" font="body" size="18" color="bg-main"><strong>Siguiente auditoría</strong></text>
  <text id="a11y-body-4" x="744" y="527" width="410" height="28" font="caption" size="13" color="#526274">Contraste AA, VoiceOver y Dynamic Type requieren prueba formal en dispositivos.</text>
  <text id="a11y-reference" x="80" y="620" width="1050" height="18" font="caption" size="13" color="surface-silver">Referencias: Apple HIG propone interfaces intuitivas, perceptibles y adaptables; WCAG 2.2: perceptible, operable, comprensible y robusta.</text>
